Package: enigma2-plugin-systemplugins-picanicockpit
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armv7ahf-neon
Maintainer: xcentaurix
Description: Slideshow transitions for enigma2 (Dreambox DM900, OpenViX). Pictures are pre-baked in C++ during the hold time and played back by moving widgets on the GPU. Used by MediaCockpit when installed.
